  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::lyricDisplay
  lines:
  - "Bells are ringin\u2019!\\nRing-ting-tingin\u2019!"
  - Lovely weather!\nSleigh ride together!
  - "Snow is fallin\u2019!\\nFriends are callin\u2019!"
  - Lovely weather!\nSleigh ride together!
  - "Let\u2019s trot along and mosey"
  - Cheeks are nice and rosy
  - "Comfy and a\u2019cozy are we!"
  - Brave against the weather
  - Snuggled up together
  - Like birds two of a feather would be!
  - Forget the fret that bore us
  - Take the road before us
  - And sing a carol chorus or two!
  - "I can\u2019t resist the call"
  - "I can\u2019t help but fall"
  - Much deeper in love with you!
  - And oh, lost in the snow
  - Nowhere\nto go
  - But by\nyour side
  - My dear, the way is clear
  - "I\u2019ll hold\\nyou near"
  - On our warm sleigh ride!
  - "Let's hear the bells a'ringin\u2019!\\nRing-ting-tingin\u2019!"
  - Lovely weather!\nSleigh ride together!
  - "Snow is fallin\u2019!\\nFriends are callin\u2019!"
  - Lovely weather!\nSleigh ride together!
  - There's a party at the home of Ms. Adachi Rei
  - It'll be the perfect ending to the perfect day
  - We'll be dancing, singing
  - Living life with friends by each our side
  - Oh, I've got an excitement nothing now could hide!
  - It's a happy feeling nothing in the world can buy
  - When the fireplace reflects and twinkles in your eye
  - If I somehow froze this moment it'd still be too little time
  - Might be the sleigh, but my heart tumbles and reels
  - Oh fuck,\nI think I'm falling head over heels!!
  - "Bells are ringin\u2019!\\nRing-ting-tingin\u2019!"
  - It's lovely weather for a sleigh ride together for two
  - "Snow is fallin\u2019!\\nFriends are callin\u2019!"
  - It's lovely weather for a sleigh ride together with you
  - "Bells are ringin\u2019!\\nRing-ting-tingin\u2019!"
  - It's lovely weather for a sleigh ride together for two
  - "Snow is fallin\u2019!\\nFriends are callin\u2019!"
  - It's lovely weather,\nforever together with you <3
  textBox: {fileID: 1198450819}
